    telling me you need a mocha.","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":166.5,"yPos":-655},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Can
    I just ask, are you okay sweetheart? I just remember last year when you kept
    ordering chai after chai...","parentUIDs":[11],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0.1,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":157.5,"yPos":-541},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"We
    both know those weren''t the best of times.","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":389.5,"yPos":-543},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You''ve
    got that melancholic look on your face again.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":381.5,"yPos":-317},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"We''ve
    all got to look out for each other.","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":29}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":373.5,"yPos":-119},"ID":28,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Glad
    you asked.","parentUIDs":[27,41],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0.1,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":30}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":374.5,"yPos":-3},"ID":29,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Well,
    I''ve always like asking customers why they come back here, to the Music Garden
    Cafe. Lately, I''ve been asking myself that, too.","parentUIDs":[28],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":32},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":33},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":34}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":367.5,"yPos":170},"ID":31,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Life
    moves so fast these days. All the new cafes are sleek and modern. Should the
    Music Garden Cafe catch up with the times?","parentUIDs":[30],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":36}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":160.5,"yPos":378},"ID":35,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"[+curiosity
    aside] Go against the grain, there will always be people curious to find out
    more.","parentUIDs":[32],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"[AI]","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0.1,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":157.5,"yPos":485},"ID":36,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You''re
    right. Every place has it''s own rhythm. ","parentUIDs":[35],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":40}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":380.5,"yPos":377},"ID":37,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"[+sympathy
    aside] There''s comfort in the familiar.","parentUIDs":[33],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"[AI]","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0.1,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":39}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":606.5,"yPos":378},"ID":38,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"[+cynicism
    aside] There''s no point in trying to fight the tide. ","parentUIDs":[34],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":true,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"[AI]","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0.1,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":604,"yPos":486},"ID":39,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You''re
    right. At least it''s quieter in here than the chaos outside.","parentUIDs":[38],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":379,"yPos":486},"ID":40,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"You''re
    right. Here are two people who still find value in that.","parentUIDs":[37],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Sofia","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0}]}'
